        },
        {
          "text": "Kera egari yarenge korentwa korwa Misiri nigo yarenge goakanerwa rigori rie chisekeli chi’echifeta amagana atano na rimo, na ebarasi nigo yarenge goakanerwa chisekeli rigana erimo, na emerongo etano. Na goetera ase abaonchoreria b’omorwoti abarwoti bonsi b’Abahiti na ab’Abasiiria nigo baarenge kogora chigari ne chibarasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
